OL,3,GNEWSAHedgehog carer and teen pageant
OL,4,Astar among winners
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the award ceremony on Friday at the
OL,7,FPittville Pump Room in Cheltenham
OL,8,Fcelebrities including comedians Bridget
OL,9,FChristie and Dom Joly, TV host Edith
OL,10,FBowman and actor William Moseley
OL,11,Fannounced the winners.
OL,13,FAwards host and breakfast show
OL,14,Fpresenter Jon Smith said: "We all know
OL,15,Fthose day-to-day heroes who go above
OL,16,Fand beyond, doing their bit, quietly
OL,17,Fgetting on with it and tonight we're
OL,18,Fcelebrating them."
